stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AUTHORIZED: Operator Registers Intent
    AUTHORIZED --> PROPOSED: AI Generates Proposal
    PROPOSED --> APPROVED: All 10 Gateway Checks Pass
    PROPOSED --> BLOCKED: Gateway Check Mismatch
    
    APPROVED --> SUBMITTED: Dispatch with Idempotency Key
    SUBMITTED --> COMPLETED: Provider Settles (200 OK)
    SUBMITTED --> PENDING: Provider Processing (202 Accepted)
    SUBMITTED --> FAILED: Provider Rejects (4xx Error)
    SUBMITTED --> UNKNOWN: Timeout / Network Disconnect
    
    PENDING --> COMPLETED: Webhook / Verification Confirms Settlement
    PENDING --> CANCEL_REQUESTED: Operator or Engine Initiates Reversal
    
    UNKNOWN --> RECONCILING: Active Query Provider State
    RECONCILING --> COMPLETED: Discovered Settled Effect on Provider
    RECONCILING --> RETRY_ALLOWED: Provider Has Zero Record of Request
    RECONCILING --> ESCALATED: Unresolvable Discrepancy / Ambiguity
    
    RETRY_ALLOWED --> SUBMITTED: Dispatch Attempt N+1
    
    CANCEL_REQUESTED --> CANCELLED: Provider Confirms Cancellation
    CANCEL_REQUESTED --> ESCALATED: Provider Rejects Cancellation
    
    BLOCKED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    ESCALATED --> [*]
